} T GE help send message

HLPSHI {
[1;36mThe [1;37mSHIELD[1;36m command will raise or lower the ship's shields. The shields will
begin charging upon being raised for the first time. They provide immediate yet
limited protection until fully charged. When fully charged, the shields come up
immediately when issued. The shields do drain on the neutron flux pile, and
will automatically come down when the energy drops to dangerously low levels.
Issue the command as follows:

  [1;37mshield [1;32m[[1;37mup[1;32m/[1;37mdown[1;32m]

[1;36mWhen firing a weapon with the shields up, the shields will be automatically
lowered. They WILL NOT be automatically raised after the firing.
[1;37m} T GE help shield message

HLPTOR {
[1;36mThe [1;37mTORPEDO[1;36m command fires a torpedo at a given ship. The torpedo guidance
