HLPZIP {
[1;36mThe [1;37mZIPPER[1;36m command launches a defensive (and sometimes offensive) weapon which
interferes with the timing mechanism on mines. The effect is to trip all mines
in the vicinity of the players ship into exploding immediately. This weapon can
be used to trip an opponent's mines after they have laid them but before they
can distance themself from them, causing the mines to do damage to the
opponent's own ship.
[1;37m} T GE help zipper message

