HLPTEA {
[1;36mThe [1;37mTEAM[1;36m command performs a number of functions related to teams.
(Never use a password you use in real life. It can be visible to others.)

Team founder commands are:
[1;37m   team start [1;32mnnnnn ssssssssss pppppppppp [team name]
[1;36m      starts a new team with code [1;32mnnnnn[1;36m, founder password [1;32mssssssssss[1;36m, member
      password [1;32mpppppppppp[1;36m, and with the team name [1;32m[team name][1;36m.
[1;37m   team kick [1;32mssssssssss [user name]
[1;36m      permits a team member with the founder password to kick another team
      member off the team. If you don't also change the password the kicked
      player can simply rejoin.
[1;37m   team newpass [1;32mssssssssss pppppppppp
[1;36m      permits a team member with the founder password to assign a new member
      password [1;32mpppppppppp[1;36m.
[1;37m   team newname [1;32mssssssssss [team name]
[1;36m      permits a team member with the founder password to change the team name
      to [1;32m[team name].

[1;36mTeam member commands are:
[1;37m   team join [1;32mnnnnn pppppppppp
[1;37m   team unjoin
   team score
   team members
} T GE team help message

HLPSPY {
[1;36mThe [1;37mSPY[1;36m command will transport a spy (provided you have one on board) to the
planet you are currently orbiting. If the spy survives and is not caught you
will from time to time get intelligence reports on the planet.

You can defend from spies by having your own spies on your planets. The more
trained spies you have, the better your chances you will catch any foreign
spies who sneak onto your planet.
[1;37m} T GE help spy message

HLPJET {
[1;36mThe [1;37mJETTISON[1;36m command permits you to dump goods from your ship. You can dump a
specific number, or all you have of a item type. You are not allowed to
jettison people. Issue the command as follows:

[1;37m  jettison [1;32m[[1;37mall[1;32m/amount] [item]

  amount[1;36m = the amount you want to jettison (or [1;37mall[1;36m)

  [1;32mitem[1;36m:
    [1;37mfig[1;36m = jettison fighters     [1;37mdec[1;36m = jettison decoys
    [1;37mmis[1;36m = jettison missiles     [1;37mmin[1;36m = jettison mines
    [1;37mtor[1;36m = jettison torpedoes    [1;37mjam[1;36m = jettison jammers
    [1;37mion[1;36m = jettison ion cannons  [1;37mzip[1;36m = jettison zippers
    [1;37mflu[1;36m = jettison flux pods    [1;37mgol[1;36m = jettison gold
    [1;37mfoo[1;36m = jettison food

Examples: [1;37mjettison ALL ion
          jet 500 foo 
} T GE help jettison message

