HLPEXT {
[1;36mThe [1;37mX[1;36m command powers down your ship and exits Galactic Empire.

The Galactic Codes of Engagement state that a user may not power down their
ship during hostilities until a cease fire period has passed. If you disconnect
from Galactic Empire by any other means during this period, when you return you
will find that your ship was destroyed, and credit for destroying the ship will
be assigned to the last ship to fire upon you.

An amendment to these rules was ratified in 3280, allowing ships to power down
at any time if they are in the neutral zone and no projectiles are incoming.
[1;37m} T GE help exit message

